.TH NETMON 1 "July 2026" "NetMon 1.1.20" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
netmon \- Linux network, security, VPN, and diagnostics desktop application
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B netmon
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B netmon
starts the graphical NetMon application. It combines network diagnostics,
DNS and firewall controls, WireGuard VPN slots, security checks, Secure
Browser management, radio functions, and guided support workflows.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --headless
Print a compact network and system status snapshot without starting Tk.
.TP
.B --headless-smoke
Create the graphical interface once for startup validation and then exit.
.TP
.BI --theme " THEME"
Start with the selected theme. Supported values include dark, light, beige,
pop, and default.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/netmon
Per-user configuration files.
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/netmon
Per-user runtime state and diagnostics.
.TP
.I ~/Documents/NetMon
Default location for user-visible reports, support bundles, and assets.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR netmon-uninstall (1)
.SH AUTHOR
NetMon Roots <info@netmonroots.com>
